  - nodeID: ciaran_3
    speaker: 1
    dialogueText: What is it?
    continueNodeID: aoife_5
    choices: []
  - nodeID: aoife_5
    speaker: 0
    dialogueText: My drawing. I can't find the right colours. They all look the same to me.
    continueNodeID: ciaran_4
    choices: []
  - nodeID: ciaran_4
    speaker: 1
    dialogueText: Which ones do you need?
    continueNodeID: aoife_6
    choices: []
